#: kmymoney/wizards/newaccountwizard/kloandetailspagedecl.ui:97
#: kmymoney/wizards/newloanwizard/interesteditwizardpagedecl.ui:103
#: kmymoney/wizards/newloanwizard/interestwizardpagedecl.ui:56
#, kde-format
